WEBVTT

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:08.410
All right, get back!

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.910
Oh, Wild!

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.410
Senri is looking so manly lately.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.700
Hey, Shiki is mine!

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:17.290
Don't push! Please don't push.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.950
It's already past the curfew

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.950
for Day Class students!

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.950
Move out of the way,

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.950
Disciplinary Committee!

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.500
Shiki!

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.540
I guess I can't handle them

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.540
all by myself...

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:33.580
...all...by myself...

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:46.540
Hey ladies. Did you dream

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:46.540
about me last night?

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.660
-- I did!

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.660
-- I did!

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:49.750
What...?

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.250
I'm so happy...

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:52.870
Then...

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.120
I'll take a detour tonight and

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.120
crash Yuki Cross's dream!

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:01.410
Huh?

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.080
No fair! Only Cross...?

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.450
Please crash my dream too...

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:06.870
W-Wait a minute, Aido...

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.080
I-I'm sorry. Kaname...?

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.950
What do you think you're doing?

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:22.160
Oh no, It's Zero Kiryu !

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.790
Things were so peaceful

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.790
while he was gone too...

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:28.580
Things I need to ask him...

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:30.620
Umm...

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:36.540
Err...

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:41.410
So many things I want to ask him...

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:44.410
How is your wound?

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:50.080
For all that time I didn't see you...

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:50.080
What was going on?

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:55.160
And... Have you satisfied

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:55.160
that intense thirst?

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:59.540
Hey, all of you go back to your dorms!

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.080
So many things I want to say...

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:04.830
The words are overflowing...

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:07.370
But...

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.660
-- No!

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.660
-- Meany!

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Zero...

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:12.250
Huh?

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:15.250
Welcome back.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:21.160
Thanks.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.370
Kaname Kuran...

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.000
BURDEN OF SINNERS

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:22.790
What's with that

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:22.790
"crash your dreams"?

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:23.870
So silly.

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:26.540
Well, if you appeared,

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:26.540
it would turn into a nightmare.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.620
What did you say?!

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.540
I admire that about you, Hanabusa.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.540
Wh-What do you mean, Akatsuki?

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.410
You always play your part.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.580
And that's not an easy thing to do.

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:50.450
Listen, everyone...

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:52.250
Huh?

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.450
I have a favor to ask.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.450
Will you hear me out?

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:11.330
With pleasure... Lord Kaname.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.410
Lord Kaname, are you sure?

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:28.250
Mmm... Such a beautiful fragrance.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.250
Hello...

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:31.330
Huh?

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.910
You only had the Day Class

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.910
to teach today?

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.200
Yeah...

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:38.330
Zero has returned.

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:43.290
I guess you would have noticed.

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:48.450
Zero was in a terrible condition.

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:51.750
I wonder how he regained

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:51.750
his sanity...

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:56.290
Well, I'm not an excellent Hunter

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:56.290
like you.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.160
There're lots of things I miss.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:05.160
However, I would never miss

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:05.160
an ugly apron like that.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.700
What? This is cute!

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:14.080
I-I'm sorry, Kaname...?

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:22.040
That guy's blood courses

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:22.040
through me.

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:25.250
Has Yuki sensed that?

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:30.000
Kaname Kuran...

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.950
Ever since I sucked his blood...

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.950
This vision I have...

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.250
of that...

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.080
that monster!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.250
Zero...

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:50.370
Shizuka Hio appeared

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:50.370
at the academy...

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:54.250
In order to stop his lapse into a Level E...

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:56.750
he had to drink the blood of that woman

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:59.160
the one forced him into

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:59.160
such a cruel fate.

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:06.950
Zero probably...couldn't drink her blood.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:13.200
I wonder how much time

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:13.200
Zero has left?

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.370
If drinking my blood could delay

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.370
his degeneration

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:21.160
even for a short while,

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:21.160
I'd let him have all he wants.

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:27.660
There's no need to worry

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:27.660
about me so much!

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.200
Zero...

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:36.080
I just wanted to protect you...

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.000
Kaname...

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.580
Be protected by Zero and Kaname...

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.830
Is that all I'm capable of...?

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:01.120
Oh...

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:04.120
Zero...

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.620
Something I'm capable of...

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:10.660
Ze-ro!

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:11.750
Oww...!

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:16.080
I worked hard all by myself

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:16.080
for a whole week.

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:18.290
Well, tonight, it's your turn!

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:20.790
Geez, you are so...!!

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:24.120
Isn't it time...you craved it?

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:29.250
I mean, you couldn't have any while

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:29.250
you were in the medical clinic, right?

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:33.120
So tonight, you can have

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:33.120
extra portions!

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:34.450
Quit joking around.

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:35.870
Oh...

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:37.200
Oh.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.290
Zero!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.040
Zero!

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.000
I'm sorry, I...

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:53.120
I told you this before...

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:56.160
...but I'm on your side!

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:03.330
I'm not much good.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:03.330
I'm really useless...

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:06.200
So much so that I hate myself...

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:11.450
I wanted you to drink her blood,

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:11.450
even if I had to force you.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.700
It was the only way to save Zero...

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.330
All I did was to cause him suffering...

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.200
I'm sorry.

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:30.580
Just what am I to you, Yuki?

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.000
Huh?

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:34.910
What are you...to me?

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:39.080
Please stop doing reckless things

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:39.080
for me.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:47.200
Oh...

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:50.620
Am I that hopeless?

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:55.000
This is terrible! This is terrible!

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:56.080
Headmaster...

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:59.330
Maria Kurenai regained

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:59.330
consciousness!

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.580
Maria Kurenai did what...?!

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.200
Ichiru!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:10.450
You lied, Headmaster.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:10.450
He's right here!

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:11.620
Well, err...

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.950
Listen, he's terrible. He said that

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.950
Lady Shizuka had perished--.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.000
You're not...

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:23.910
Could you be Zero...?

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.000
Maria...!

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:30.160
I see... So Lady Shizuka met you.

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:35.080
Then...she really did die...

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:43.120
Lady Shizuka came to me and asked

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:43.120
if she can use me as her vessel.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:46.080
So I agreed to loan her

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:46.080
my body time to time.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:49.200
In exchange, Lady Shizuka said

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.870
she would restore me to good health.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:56.540
But we are blood relatives...

00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:58.370
I didn't desire any kind of payment.

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:03.160
Shortly after she was born,

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:03.160
Lady Shizuka was put into isolation

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:05.000
under the pretext of protecting her,

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:07.830
and she never experienced love

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:07.830
from anyone.

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:13.660
That man she loved was

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:13.660
the first person ever

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:15.660
to show her any love.

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.290
After losing him,

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.250
she lost herself and was filled

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.250
with sadness and hate.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:22.950
Zero...

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:28.500
Even if she was killed by you,

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:28.500
I don't think she begrudged you!

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.540
Now, now... Calm down.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:32.620
You don't want a relapse.

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:34.080
Maria, that's...!

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:36.700
Come now, Yuki.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:36.700
We must let her rest.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:38.250
Zero, you too.

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:42.160
Wait... Zero.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:46.200
I want to tell you, at least, the truth...

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:48.080
What is it?

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:53.040
That day, the Kiryus were pawns

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:53.040
to get them to hunt the man...

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:55.660
There was a mastermind

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:55.660
pulling the strings.

00:11:57.200 --> 00:12:00.750
Someone who was not pleased

00:11:57.200 --> 00:12:00.750
that Shizuka, a Pureblood,

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:03.120
loved an ex-human vampire.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:08.040
Shizuka discovered the existence

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:08.040
of this mastermind,

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:11.040
and she tried to gain new powers

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:11.040
in order to bring him down...

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:15.580
I believe her enemy

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:15.580
is the Purebloods'...

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:17.370
and your true enemy.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:21.080
My true enemy?

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:28.160
Maria also believes...

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:28.160
that Zero killed Shizuka.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:30.450
But...at that time, Zero was...

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:30.450
Strange... I'm sure there was...

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:50.620
Good evening, Miss.

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:50.620
This is Cross Academy, is it not?

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:55.870
Oh my... I came after work

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:55.870
so the hour is late.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.250
This sensation...

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.790
You're a vampire, aren't you?

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:03.540
I see... You are a Guardian too.

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:05.660
Then tell me.

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:07.500
What is it?

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:10.660
Where is...the other Guardian?

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:14.450
Zero!

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:16.870
What do you want with me?

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.370
Zero Kiryu...

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:22.370
For the crime of murdering

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:22.370
a Pureblood, Shizuka Hio...

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:29.200
By order of the highest authority,

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:29.200
the Senate, I shall execute you.

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:41.660
The Senate takes pride in

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:41.660
protecting the Purebloods,

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:47.500
and yet you slipped through

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:47.500
and killed Lady Shizuka.

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:49.370
Wait! Zero isn't...

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:50.450
Back off.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:52.160
Huh?

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:57.160
You can pay for this grievous crime

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:57.160
with your life alone.

00:13:57.450 --> 00:13:58.870
A cheap price, wouldn't you say?

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:04.950
Wha--?! How dare you crush

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:04.950
a vampire's bones...

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:08.000
You soon-to-be Level E!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.450
My strength has increased.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.080
Zero...

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:20.370
I'm sorry but I can no longer

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:20.370
sell my life cheap.

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:23.000
You can't escape from it.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:27.950
You will be executed by us.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:27.950
That is your destiny...

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:37.580
This has nothing to do with you.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:37.580
So go.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:38.950
I can't do that.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:46.620
Shizuka had done something

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:46.620
that made it inevitable

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.500
that Zero would hunt her down.

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:53.000
Lord Kaname Kuran...!

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:56.450
Even if she was hunted by Zero...

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:01.870
So why must Zero be executed

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:01.870
for the purpose

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:04.660
of upholding the sanctity

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:04.660
of the Purebloods?

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:09.790
Kaname, if a Pureblood such

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:09.790
as yourself interferes,

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:11.450
we will not be able to complete

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:11.450
our mission.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:16.120
I would ask to avoid sullying

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:16.120
this Academy,

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:19.750
which I hold dear,

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:19.750
from your foolish actions...

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:21.750
you dogs of the Senate!

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:23.580
Lord Kaname!

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:29.160
Leave.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:32.250
Your choice to protect Zero Kiryu...

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:38.410
...will be duly reported to the Senate,

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:38.410
Lord Kaname!

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.540
Are you all right?

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:46.620
What's the big idea, Kaname Kuran?

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:48.620
I couldn't ignore it...

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:54.290
The senseless execution of a fellow student

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:54.290
by foolish men of my race.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:15:59.790
Zero!

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:04.540
Thank you very much!

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.120
-- Don't mention it.

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.120
-- Thank you.

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:12.330
But there is no reason

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:12.330
why Zero should be targeted.

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:14.500
I know.

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:16.790
Don't worry.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:20.580
Uh... No, you don't understand!

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:23.580
-- How dare you speak that way to...

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:23.580
-- Now, now...

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:27.040
Come on, everyone,

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:27.040
let's go back to our rooms.

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:28.580
-- But Lord Kaname was...

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:28.580
-- Let's go.

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:40.120
What don't I understand?

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:43.870
That Shizuka was killed by Zero.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:47.830
Zero did no such thing!

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:53.580
Yuki, I'm not trying to turn

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:53.580
Zero into a villain.

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:57.870
Then acknowledge that

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:57.870
Zero is not the culprit!

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:01.200
Certainly. If you say so,

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:01.200
I acknowledge it.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:02.580
Huh?

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:05.700
I'm serious.

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:08.660
And I have always been serious

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:08.660
about you.

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:10.500
Zero is not the culprit.

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:13.540
This talk is going nowhere, Yuki.

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:15.540
I don't care if it goes nowhere!

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:23.540
Until you truly admit it,

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:23.540
I will not speak to you anymore!

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:29.000
This isn't a child's fight...

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:35.540
Oh, sorry, sorry...

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:42.910
Going so far as to defy the Senate

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:42.910
to protect Cross Academy...

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.870
Just what is Lord Kaname thinking?

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:48.450
Does it matter what he's thinking?

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.620
Shiki, you...

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:54.580
What he's thinking has no bearing.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.870
We simply obey. That's all.

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:01.540
I find this place quite comfortable...

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:02.950
Shiki...

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:06.700
Because Dorm President Kuran

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:06.700
created this place for us...

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:09.910
I agree with Shiki.

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:11.750
You're right, I...

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:15.580
The Night Class exists with

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:15.580
Lord Kaname...

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:17.540
Me too!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:20.700
Me too...

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:30.370
What's wrong?

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:33.330
Oh, sorry. Did I wake you?

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:35.250
Can't sleep?

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:39.830
Yeah. I was thinking that

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:39.830
I'm such a child.

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:41.500
I know.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:42.580
Huh?

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:46.830
But I don't think that childishness

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:46.830
in you is a weakness.

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:48.830
Good night.

00:18:49.910 --> 00:18:50.910
Yori...

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:01.160
Need something?

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:03.200
It was you, wasn't it?

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:08.540
The one who killed Shizuka Hio

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:08.540
after I injured her...

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:13.580
I've heard that the blood of

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:13.580
a Pureblood has great powers.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:16.830
So? Did you get it?

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:21.000
You heard? You ask as if it

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:21.000
doesn't involve you.

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:24.450
But you have first-hand

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:24.450
knowledge too, don't you?

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:29.700
You know, my blood can't really

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:29.700
save you.

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:31.790
I pity you, Zero.

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:36.870
But I envy you too, being able to

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:36.870
protect the girl you care about.

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:40.120
Hey! We're not done talking!

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:45.910
Maria told me...who the real enemy

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:45.910
of the Purebloods is!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.450
There is no need for you to know.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.080
You...

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:53.500
I just realized...that there is

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:53.500
another way of looking at it.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:59.500
You can protect Yuki because

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:59.500
my blood flows inside you.

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:05.540
It's as though I am the one

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:05.540
protecting Yuki, not you.

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:13.410
Don't mess with me!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:33.540
Kaname Kuran's blood lives

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:33.540
inside me.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.450
Isn't it time...you craved it?

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:42.250
Since I sucked Kuran Kaname's blood,

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:44.250
my thirst should have been

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:44.250
satisfied for a while.

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:49.540
But I really wanted Yuki's blood...

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:53.580
How you must have wanted to kill me...

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:55.410
Zero Kiryu.

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:59.830
Now that you have lost

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:59.830
the object of your hate,

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:01.700
where will you go?

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:09.080
Perhaps the cruel instincts of

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:09.080
a vampire will take over...

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:16.200
Blood...

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:22.830
The pungent sweet smell of blood...

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:24.500
Yuki!

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:25.580
Zero...?

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:29.910
What's wrong?

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:31.870
Yuki!

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:33.830
You're alive.

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:34.910
Zero?

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:37.910
I thought I had killed you.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:40.250
Zero, I can't breathe...

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:42.500
Zero.

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:43.580
Are you all right?

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:46.540
Yeah.

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:49.160
I'm glad.

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:57.700
Yes... I want this gentle hand

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:57.700
and smile...

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:01.330
Oh...

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:08.250
It's nothing...

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:13.330
The Senate sent men

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:13.330
to the Academy?

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:14.700
Yes.

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:17.200
What is the Hunter's Society doing?

00:22:17.660 --> 00:22:19.250
No matter how you look at it, they...

00:22:21.290 --> 00:22:22.540
This is from the Hunter's Society...

00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:25.290
A letter addressed to Zero.

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:04.290
Next time:

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:04.290
"The Eternal Promise"
